WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.224
SHE STOLE OUR AI CHIP!
AND SHE'S STILL INSIDE THE BUILDING!
If that woman escapes, NEXA could lose EVERYTHING!

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.300
OhBhai! I'm right behind her!

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:09.872
You won't catch me!

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.120
Ryan, don't let her reach that exit!

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:20.960
Wait! We finally got a clear look at her!
Her name is Mei Lin, and she planned this escape
before we even knew she was inside!

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:25.340
You should have protected your vault,
not trusted your people.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:28.560
OhBhai! Her signal is splitting!

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:31.444
What?! How is she doing that?

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.328
Guys, stop! We've got another emergency! Nvidia has officially
announced that Jensen Huang has resigned as CEO and board member!
Colette Kress is taking over as interim CEO!

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.464
Wait! He's actually leaving?

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.328
Yes! And the entire market is watching!

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:54.384
And the market is reacting! Nvidia shares fell
more than 8 percent in after-hours trading. More than
550 BILLION dollars in market value lost since the investigation began!

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:56.192
That's unbelievable!

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:59.620
And remember, market value isn't the same
as cash in the bank!

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:06.848
And now our own company is collapsing!
NEXA's simulated value has dropped from
1.02 trillion dollars to just 690 billion!

00:01:07.050 --> 00:01:10.122
Investors are cancelling their contracts!

00:01:10.322 --> 00:01:13.730
Everything is going exactly as planned.

00:01:13.930 --> 00:01:15.682
We have a bigger problem than we thought!

00:01:15.882 --> 00:01:21.810
And now the worst news! Under massive public
and investor pressure, our fictional NEXA CEO
has just resigned!

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:24.914
What happens to our employees?
My dad helped build this company!

00:01:25.114 --> 00:01:27.298
I know, Chris. But we still have
a chance to save it!

00:01:27.498 --> 00:01:30.066
Now let's see how quickly they fall apart.

00:01:30.266 --> 00:01:38.330
The board has given us one final mission! We have four
minutes before the emergency lockdown window closes.
We must catch Mei Lin, recover the chip and prove NEXA is still secure!

00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:39.394
I'll find her!

00:01:39.594 --> 00:01:41.130
I'll track the chip!

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:44.114
Then let's move! Nobody leaves this facility
until we finish!

00:01:44.314 --> 00:01:50.698
Daniel has discovered something terrifying!
Mei Lin didn't open the vault alone. Someone approved
a founder-level access code before she entered!

00:01:50.898 --> 00:01:53.610
That means someone inside helped her!

00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:56.402
You're finally asking the right questions.

00:01:56.602 --> 00:01:58.018
Who gave you that access, Mei?

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:06.272
Mike has found the chip's signal! But there's a problem.
Two locations are showing the same signature! One is real,
and the other is a trap!

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:08.824
She's using a decoy!

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:13.224
Keep following the signal, OhBhai.
You'll never find me.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.136
Nice try, Mei! We're not falling for that!

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:21.384
Wait! We've found her! Mei is heading toward
the loading bay, but two identical trucks
are leaving the facility!

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:24.168
I can see her! She's in the second vehicle!

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:26.464
Goodbye, gentlemen!

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:29.504
Ryan, follow that truck! Don't lose her again!

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:36.680
We're running out of time, but Chris just found something!
His father helped build this facility, and he remembers
a secret freight tunnel that isn't on our new maps!

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:39.732
It connects directly to the old testing laboratory!

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:42.612
Then that's where Mei is heading!
Show us the way!

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:50.672
We found the transport container, but the chip isn't here!
Mei knew we would follow this route. She wanted us
to waste our time!

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:52.532
Then where did she go?

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:56.108
This device is still transmitting a signal!

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.488
She's nearby! Keep moving!

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:05.504
THERE SHE IS! Mei isn't trying to escape anymore!
She's connecting the stolen chip
to our experimental AI system!

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:10.448
Thirty more seconds, and you'll understand
why I needed this chip.

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:13.096
She's activating something!

00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:16.632
Stop her! Whatever she's doing,
we cannot let it finish!

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:22.324
Mei! What are you trying to access? Why steal one chip
when you could have escaped with the entire case?

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:26.248
Because the chip is not the prize. It's the key.

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:32.472
OhBhai… Project Orion is
our most restricted system!

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:34.736
Step away from that console, Mei!

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:39.764
She's moving! Ryan, block the exit!
Chris, secure the other door! She's trying
to escape with the chip again!

00:03:39.964 --> 00:03:42.028
You really thought you could trap me?

00:03:42.228 --> 00:03:44.100
This time, there's nowhere to run!

00:03:44.300 --> 00:03:45.452
Close the final barrier!

00:03:45.652 --> 00:03:49.636
WE GOT HER! The spy is finally trapped, and the stolen
AI chip is back in our hands!

00:03:49.836 --> 00:03:50.820
It's over, Mei!

00:03:51.020 --> 00:03:53.348
You think catching me ends this?

00:03:53.548 --> 00:03:54.820
Then tell me who sent you!

00:03:55.020 --> 00:03:57.492
You're asking the wrong person.

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:05.288
We recovered the chip, but Daniel just found another problem!
Someone tried to access it remotely before we caught Mei!

00:04:05.490 --> 00:04:09.810
The system blocked the request.
No customer files were accessed.

00:04:10.010 --> 00:04:14.066
You still don't understand.
I wasn't supposed to leave with the chip.

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:15.638
Then what was your real mission?

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:23.688
We cannot just recover the chip and celebrate!
We need proof that NEXA is secure! Mike isolates the system,
Daniel verifies every record, and Ryan rebuilds our security!

00:04:23.890 --> 00:04:25.546
The employees are waiting for answers!

00:04:25.750 --> 00:04:28.198
Then we'll tell them the truth. No fake promises!

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:38.624
WE DID IT! We recovered the chip, secured our systems,
gave the board verified evidence and restored customer confidence!
Our simulated company value is back above one trillion dollars!

00:04:38.824 --> 00:04:39.952
We saved the company!

00:04:40.152 --> 00:04:41.496
And we're number one again!

00:04:41.696 --> 00:04:48.176
We caught the spy, recovered the chip and saved our company.
But Daniel has found a second administrator who approved
the theft before Mei even entered!

00:04:48.376 --> 00:04:52.048
OhBhai… she had someone working with her!

00:04:52.248 --> 00:04:55.920
You caught the thief. You still haven't found
the person who hired me.

00:04:56.120 --> 00:04:59.048
Then someone inside NEXA is still working with her…

